<title>USA: IPO PRICING-Roadhouse Grill not effective.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-Roadhouse Grill not effective.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of Roadhouse Grill Inc has been priced but has not gone effective yet, lead underwriter for the deal Piper Jaffray said Friday.</p>
<p>The offering of 2.5 million shares was expected to price between $9 and $11 a share and will trade on the Nasdaq market under the symbol &quot;GRLL.&quot;</p>
<p>The underwriter said more information will be available later Friday morning.</p>
<p>The Fort Lauderdale, Fla.-based company owns and operates casual dinner restaurants.</p>
</text>
